  20:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c ****  *
  21:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c ****  *  \brief    Implementation of package fsReg of library functional safety.
  22:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c ****  *
  23:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c ****  *  \details  Work registers and the condition codes (flags) of a
  24:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c **** specific controller are checked by this task. This task is thought to be so-called one-time check a
  25:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c **** continuous check while operational work.
  26:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c **** \n
  27:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c **** \n
  28:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsReg.c **** <b>Functional Safety Register Check Component - Top-Level Design</b>
